  "description": "A deliberately thin lifecycle bridge over grpc-dotnet for the FS.GG.Net component — the BAR substrate. FS.GG.Net does NOT re-abstract gRPC's method dispatch (grpc-dotnet and protobuf-net.Grpc already do that well); it only projects a gRPC channel's connectivity onto the shared ConnectionState so gRPC-based apps share the component's lifecycle idiom. ADR-0052.",
